name: Connect with Pollinations
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/connect-with-pollinations/icon.svg
version: 1.2.0
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Wires a Pollinations AI model (via gen.pollinations.ai's OpenAI-compatible endpoint) into Sugarcane. Adds a Pollinations Configuration sidebar section (API key optional on the free tier, model name, scoped page/element permissions, auto-execute, Explore Mode, gated UI-click access) and a dockable chat panel. The AI reads and controls the editor through an 80+ command slash protocol — find/replace, formatting, lists, headings, tables, page/zoom/spellcheck/dark-mode toggles, margins, background, watermark, headers/footers, export/print, stats, and more — auto-run or approve-each-time. Explore Mode attaches a live UI + document snapshot to every message. Optionally, /click lets the AI click any labeled UI control, gated in batches of 30 clicks per user confirmation.
p/html:
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/connect-with-pollinations/connect-with-pollinations.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/connect-with-pollinations/connect-with-pollinations.js

